   "key": "needs1116",
   "record": "0adc0cb00491e9f92dfaa758be7118717259fa340502708e3efe22fb2413aaab",
   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040gi p. 115, Schedule 3 line 1, \"You aren't filing Form 4563 or excluding income from sources within Puerto Rico\" is the condition the reply finds tested (the BUG-0769 fix). sa.excluded_income also names Form 2555, which neither i1116 pp. 1-2 nor Schedule 3 lists; a Form 2555 filer with foreign tax is therefore sent to Form 1116, where f1116.reduction (foreign taxes on income excluded on Form 2555 or 4563, line 12) refuses. The extra condition turns an election credit into a refusal, never into a different amount on a completed return.",
   "subject_key": "8d6577b7121da852c1e3b877c8b57deed8ca9a7a6cb8d0ef0283a28916a06d3f"
  },
  {
