   "key": "credit_tax",
   "record": "0adc0cb00491e9f92dfaa758be7118717259fa340502708e3efe22fb2413aaab",
   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; the Form 4972 subtraction is the regular_tax ruling (i1116 p. 25, Line 20, \"less any tax included on line 16 from Form 4972\"; Form 4972 tax is refused at Form 1040 line 16 by scope.other_line16, so nothing is subtracted on a computed return), and the Form 2555 condition is the needs1116 ruling (a Form 2555 filer with foreign tax is refused at f1116.reduction). The Form 1116 branch matches, as the reply says.",
   "subject_key": "63c4ffa5c31a6a2942a65c2461848a4aa76f7480af4a6893ec9e6a4998c1d877"
